    "text": "radiomankato.com\nwebsite\nMankato\nScoreboard from Tuesday July 9th\n12 hours ago\nThe Mankato Moondogs have lost 4 in a row, as they fell to Willmar on the road last night 4-1. The Moondogs are now 4-4 in the 2nd half of the season. Mankato has a double header at ISG Field today against Willmar. Game 1 at 12:35, Game 2 at 6:35.",
